line of record v1.00.11: fast-gate p50 488.0 s over 10 L3 +\n  2 L4 runs; halving target p50 <= 244.0 s (<=50% of baseline);\n  --check and --fast-budget --check byte-identical\n- W3 one-off scripts: guard bodies with invoked-directly? so raco test\n  on scripts/run-tests/ passes (no side effects at module load)\n\n* feat(v1.00.16 W1+W2): grouped in-process eligibility + fast-timesink remediation\n\nW1 — grouped in-process execution for eligible fast files:\n- grouped-eligible? contract in runner.rkt: no @isolation process/subprocess,\n  no truthy @mutates, (module+ test) form only; all other files keep the\n  subprocess path byte-for-byte.\n\nW2 — top time-sink remediation (no test deleted/weakened/merged):\n- oauth-callback: #:on-complete production seam on start-callback-server;\n  deterministic semaphore synchronization replaces alarm-evt sleeps and the\n  unsafe poll-probe loop (probe could complete the one-shot server with #f\n  before the real callback arrived).\n  test-oauth-callback-nonblocking: 8.23s -> 1.40s; security: 5.23s -> 1.44s.\n- auto-retry: current-auto-retry-sleep-scale seam (1.0 = production wall-clock,\n  0.0 = deterministic tests; computed delay unchanged in events/stats).\n- shared fixture builders: tests/helpers/{fast,oauth-callback}-fixtures.rkt.\n- runner/reporting: fix --json-out crash for string result paths\n  (path->string contract violation aborted JSON emission silently).\n\nReport: docs/reports/fast-timesink-remediation-v1.00.16.md\n\n* chore(lint): README metrics re-sync + resolve leftover merge conflict marker\n\n* fix(lint): wrap over-long literals in baseline-report (from W0); metrics re-sync\n\n* fix(arch): register new parameters in inventory; lifecycle banner compaction\n\n- parameter-inventory.rktd: +current-auto-retry-sleep-scale (CONFIGURATION,\n  v1.00.16 W2 backoff test seam) and +current-conn-pool (SERVICE_HANDLE,\n  BUG-0019 W2, was missed at merge) — fixes test-arch-parameters on main.\n- session-lifecycle.rkt: collapse 3-line section banners to single lines and\n  drop dangling trailing banner (611 -> 600 lines, back within budget).\n- test-arch-parameters expected count 199 -> 201 with provenance comments.\n\n* chore(lint): metrics re-sync\n\n* fix(arch): parameter inventory count 199 -> 204 (was stale on main: 202 uncounted entries + 2 new seams)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: coinerd <coinerd@users.noreply.github.com>","timestamp":"2026-08-24T15:59:17Z","author":{"name":"coinerd","email":"zeiler@outlook.com"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com"}},"repository":{"id":1204314088,"node_id":"R_kgDOR8hf6A","name":"q","full_name":"coinerd/q","private":false,"owner":{"login":"coinerd","id":10107520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NTIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10107520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coinerd","html_url":"https://github.com/coinerd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coinerd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coinerd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coinerd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coinerd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coinerd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coinerd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coinerd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coinerd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coinerd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/coinerd/q","description":"racket coding agent","fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coinerd/q","forks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coinerd/q/forks","keys_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coinerd/q/keys{/key_id}","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coinerd/q/collaborators{/collaborator}","teams_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/c